 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Loin de",
     "texto": [
      "**Loin de** + infinitive or noun means «far from» in a figurative sense: **Loin de me plaindre, je travaille beaucoup** (far from complaining, I work a lot).",
      "**Loin de là** is an emphatic negation: **Tu es triste ? Loin de là !** (are you sad? Far from it!)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Contrast",
     "texto": [
      "**Contrairement à** (unlike) and **à l'inverse** (the other way round) mark opposition: **Contrairement à moi, tu aimes le sport** (unlike me, you like sport)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Expression",
